ize:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"></p></td><td style="width:50.0%;border:none;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height:14.2pt" valign="top" width="50%"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:13.1pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:  "Times New Roman",serif">1. Yakuniy baholash natijalari boʻyicha oilaning portretini shakllantiradi va oilani “davlat taʼminotidagi oila” va “kambagʻal oila” deb topadi yoki rad etadi.</p></td><td style="width:1.0%;border-top:none;border-left:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height:14.2pt" valign="top" width="1%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"></p></td><td style="width:18.18%;border:none;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height:14.2pt" valign="top" width="18%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1. Avtomatik tarzda</p></td></tr><tr style="height:14.2pt"><td style="width:1.0%;border:none;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height:14.2pt" width="1%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"></p></td><td style="width:1.0%;border:none;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height:14.2pt" width="1%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"></p></td><td style="width:50.0%;border-top:none;border-left:  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height:14.2pt" valign="top" width="50%"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:13.1pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:  "Times New Roman",serif">2. Reyestrga kiritilgan oilaning toifasini belgilaydi.</p></td><td style="width:1.0%;border:none;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height:14.2pt" valign="top" width="1%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"></p></td><td style="width:18.18%;border-top:none;border-left:  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height:14.2pt" valign="top" width="18%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2. Avtomatik tarzda</p></td></tr><tr style="height:14.2pt"><td style="width:10.0%;border:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height:14.2pt" width="10%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"></p></td><td style="width:1.0%;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height:14.2pt" width="1%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"></p></td><td style="width:14.96%;border:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height:14.2pt" width="14%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"></p></td><td style="width:1.0%;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height:14.2pt" width="1%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"></p></td><td style="width:50.0%;border:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height:14.2pt" width="50%"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:13.1pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:  "Times New Roman",serif"></p></td><td style="width:1.0%;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height:14.2pt" width="1%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"></p></td><td style="width:18.18%;border:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height:14.2pt" width="18%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"></p></td></tr><tr style="height:14.2pt"><td rowspan="2" style="width:10.0%;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top:none;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height:14.2pt" width="10%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">7-bosqich</p></td><td style="width:1.0%;border-top:none;border-left:none;border-bottom:  solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height:14.2pt" width="1%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="width:14.96%;border-top:none;border-left:  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height:14.2pt" width="14%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">“Mahalla yettiligi”</p></td><td style="width:1.0%;border-top:none;border-left:none;border-bottom:  solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height:14.2pt" width="1%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="width:50.0%;border-top:none;border-left:  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height:14.2pt" width="50%"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:13.1pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:  "Times New Roman",serif">1. Ogʻir hayotiy vaziyatga tushgan oila mezonlariga mos boʻlgan oilani “kambagʻallik chegarasidagi oila” toifasiga kiritish toʻgʻrisida tavsiya beradi.</p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:13.1pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:  "Times New Roman",serif">2. Dastlabki baholash natijasi boʻyicha “davlat taʼminotidagi oila” va “kambagʻal oila” deb topish rad etilgan oilalar uchun belgilangan tartibda xulosani tasdiqlaydi.</p></td><td style="width:1.0%;border-top:none;border-left:none;border-bottom:  solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height:14.2pt" width="1%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="width:18.18%;border-top:none;border-left:  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height:14.2pt" width="18%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">“Davlat taʼminotidagi oila” va “kambagʻal oila” deb topish rad etilgan kundan keyin oʻttiz kun ichida</p></td></tr><tr style="height:14.2pt"><td style="width:1.0%;border:none;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height:14.2pt" width="1%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"></p></td><td style="width:1.0%;border:none;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height:14.2pt" width="1%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"></p></td><td style="width:1.0%;border:none;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height:14.2pt" width="1%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"></p></td></tr><tr style="height:14.2pt"><td style="width:10.0%;border:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height:14.2pt" width="10%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"></p></td><td style="width:1.0%;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height:14.2pt" width="1%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"></p></td><td style="width:14.96%;border:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height:14.2pt" width="14%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"></p></td><td style="width:1.0%;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height:14.2pt" width="1%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"></p></td><td style="width:50.0%;border:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height:14.2pt" width="50%"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:13.1pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:  "Times New Roman",serif"></p></td><td style="width:1.0%;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height:14.2pt" width="1%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"></p></td><td style="width:18.18%;border:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height:14.2pt" width="18%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"></p></td></tr><tr style="height:14.2pt"><td rowspan="3" style="width:10.0%;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top:none;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height:14.2pt" width="10%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">8-bosqich</p></td><td style="width:1.0%;border-top:none;border-left:none;border-bottom:  solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height:14.2pt" width="1%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="width:14.96%;border-top:none;border-left:  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height:14.2pt" width="14%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">“Ijtimoiy reyestr” axborot moduli</p></td><td style="width:1.0%;border-top:none;border-left:none;border-bottom:  solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height:14.2pt" width="1%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"></p></td><td style="width:50.0%;border:none;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height:14.2pt" valign="top" width="50%"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:13.1pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:  "Times New Roman",serif">1. Yakuniy baholash natijalari boʻyicha oilani ogʻir hayotiy vaziyatga tushgan oila sifatida “kambagʻallik chegarasidagi oila” toifasiga kiritadi.</p></td><td style="width:1.0%;border-top:none;border-left:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height:14.2pt" valign="top" width="1%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"></p></td><td style="width:18.18%;border:none;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height:14.2pt" valign="top" width="18%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1. Avtomatik tarzda</p></td></tr><tr style="height:14.2pt"><td style="width:1.0%;border:none;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height:14.2pt" width="1%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"></p></td><td style="width:1.0%;border:none;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height:14.2pt" width="1%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"></p></td><td style="width:50.0%;border:none;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height:14.2pt" valign="top" width="50%"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:13.1pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:  "Times New Roman",serif">2. “Mahalla yettiligi” tavsiya bergan oilani “kambagʻallik chegarasidagi oila” toifasiga mosligini oʻrganadi, oʻrganish natijasiga koʻra oilani “kambagʻallik chegarasidagi oila” toifasiga kiritadi yoki rad etadi.</p></td><td style="width:1.0%;border:none;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height:14.2pt" valign="top" width="1%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"></p></td><td style="width:18.18%;border:none;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height:14.2pt" valign="top" width="18%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2. Oʻttiz kun ichida</p></td></tr><tr style="height:14.2pt"><td style="width:1.0%;border:none;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height:14.2pt" width="1%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"></p></td><td style="width:1.0%;border:none;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height:14.2pt" width="1%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"></p></td><td style="width:50.0%;border-top:none;border-left:  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height:14.2pt" valign="top" width="50%"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:13.1pt;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:  "Times New Roman",serif">3. Oilaning “davlat taʼminotidagi oila”, “kambagʻal oila” deb eʼtirof etilganligi yoki rad etilganligi, uning toifasi, Reyestrga kiritilganligi yoki Reyestrga kiritish rad etilgani haqidagi maʼlumotlarni ariza beruvchining mobil telefon raqamiga SMS-xabar yuboradi.</p></td><td style="width:1.0%;border:none;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height:14.2pt" valign="top" width="1%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"></p></td><td style="width:18.18%;border-top:none;border-left:  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height:14.2pt" valign="top" width="18%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3. Avtomatik tarzda</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="-8030167" id="-8030167"></div></div><div class="APPL_BANNER_LANDSCAPE_TITLE"><div name="-8030168" id="-8030168">Ijtimoiy reyestrni yuritish tartibi toʻgʻrisidagi <a href="https://lex.uz/uz/docs/-8027513#-8029846">nizomga</a><br />2-ILOVA</div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="-8030169" id="-8030169"></div></div><div class="TABLE_STD"><div name="-8030170" id="-8030170" class="tabBox"><table border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 825px;border-collapse: collapse;border: none" width="100%"><tbody><tr style="height: 14.2pt"><td colspan="5" style="width: 3.0%;border: none;padding: 0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height: 14.2pt" width="3%"><p align="right" style="text-align: right;margin: 0in 2.8pt .0001pt 2.8pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><strong style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif">NAMUNA</strong></span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 14.2pt"><td colspan="5" style="width: 3.0%;border: none;padding: 0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height: 14.2pt" width="3%"><p align="center" style="text-align: center;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;margin: 0in 2.8pt .0001pt 2.8pt"></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 14.2pt"><td colspan="5" style="width: 3.0%;border: none;padding: 0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height: 14.2pt" width="3%"><p align="center" style="text-align: center;margin: 0in 2.8pt .0001pt 2.8pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><strong style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif">Ijtimoiy reyestrga kiritish boʻyicha</strong></span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 14.2pt"><td colspan="5" style="width: 3.0%;border: none;padding: 0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height: 14.2pt" width="3%"><p align="center" style="text-align: center;margin: 0in 2.8pt .0001pt 2.8pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><stro