 colspan="2" style="width: 72.7%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding: 0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height: 14.2pt" valign="top" width="72%"><p style="text-align: justify;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;margin: 0in 2.85pt .0001pt 5.55pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt">Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Mudofaa vazirligi, Ichki ishlar vazirligi, Favqulodda vaziyatlar vazirligi, Davlat xavfsizlik xizmati, Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Prezidenti Davlat xavfsizlik xizmati, Milliy gvardiya, Iqtisodiyot va moliya vazirligi huzuridagi Bojxona qoʻmitasi, Mudofaa vazirligi huzuridagi Mudofaa sanoati agentligi hamda ularning tizimidagi tashkilotlar xizmatchilari va xodimlari hamda pensionerlari soni</span></p></td><td colspan="2" style="width: 20.92%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding: 0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height: 14.2pt" valign="top" width="20%"><p style="text-align: justify;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;margin: 0in 2.8pt .0001pt 2.8pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt">__ nafar</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 14.2pt"><td style="width: 3.0%;border: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height: 14.2pt" width="3%"><p align="center" style="text-align: center;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt">8.</span></p></td><td colspan="2" style="width: 72.7%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding: 0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height: 14.2pt" valign="top" width="72%"><p style="text-align: justify;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;margin: 0in 2.85pt .0001pt 5.55pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt">Chet elda jazoni ijro etish muassasasida boʻlganligi munosabati bilan oilada boʻlmagan shaxslar soni</span></p></td><td colspan="2" style="width: 20.92%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding: 0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height: 14.2pt" valign="top" width="20%"><p style="text-align: justify;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;margin: 0in 2.8pt .0001pt 2.8pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt">__ nafar</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 14.2pt"><td rowspan="6" style="width: 3.0%;border: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height: 14.2pt" width="3%"><p align="center" style="text-align: center;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt">9.</span></p></td><td rowspan="6" style="width: 54.48%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding: 0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height: 14.2pt" valign="top" width="54%"><p style="text-align: justify;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;margin: 0in 2.8pt .0001pt 5.55pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt">Ogʻir hayotiy vaziyat yuzaga kelganligi boʻyicha asoslar mavjudligi</span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin: 0in 2.8pt .0001pt 5.55pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><em style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif">(toifalarning biri belgilanadi)</em></span></p></td><td colspan="2" style="width: 30.8%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding: 0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height: 14.2pt" valign="top" width="30%"><p style="text-align: justify;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;margin: 0in 2.8pt .0001pt 2.8pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt">I va (yoki) II guruh nogironligi boʻlgan shaxs yoxud bolalikdan nogironligi boʻlgan shaxs bor oila</span></p></td><td style="width: 8.34%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding: 0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height: 14.2pt" valign="top" width="8%"><p style="text-align: justify;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;margin: 0in 2.8pt .0001pt 2.8pt"></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 14.2pt"><td colspan="2" style="width: 30.8%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding: 0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height: 14.2pt" valign="top" width="30%"><p style="text-align: justify;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;margin: 0in 2.8pt .0001pt 2.8pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt">Boquvchisini yoʻqotgan yoki bolasini yolgʻiz tarbiyalayotgan oila</span></p></td><td style="width: 8.34%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding: 0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height: 14.2pt" valign="top" width="8%"><p style="text-align: justify;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;margin: 0in 2.8pt .0001pt 2.8pt"></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 14.2pt"><td colspan="2" style="width: 30.8%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding: 0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height: 14.2pt" valign="top" width="30%"><p style="text-align: justify;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;margin: 0in 2.8pt .0001pt 2.8pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt">Oʻzgalar parvarishiga muhtoj boʻlgan yolgʻiz yashovchi hamda yolgʻiz shaxs</span></p></td><td style="width: 8.34%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding: 0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height: 14.2pt" valign="top" width="8%"><p style="text-align: justify;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;margin: 0in 2.8pt .0001pt 2.8pt"></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 14.2pt"><td colspan="2" style="width: 30.8%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding: 0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height: 14.2pt" valign="top" width="30%"><p style="text-align: justify;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;margin: 0in 2.8pt .0001pt 2.8pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt">Oila aʼzosi muddatli harbiy xizmatda yoki jazoni ijro etish muassasasida boʻlgan oila</span></p></td><td style="width: 8.34%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding: 0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height: 14.2pt" valign="top" width="8%"><p style="text-align: justify;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;margin: 0in 2.8pt .0001pt 2.8pt"></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 14.2pt"><td colspan="2" style="width: 30.8%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding: 0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height: 14.2pt" valign="top" width="30%"><p style="text-align: justify;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;margin: 0in 2.8pt .0001pt 2.8pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt">Oila aʼzosi psixiatriya, narkologiya, sil kasalliklari dispanserida boʻlgan yoki onkologiya markazlarida roʻyxatda boʻlgan yoxud gematologiya, immunologiya, jigar, buyrak yetishmovchiligi kabi ogʻir kasallikka chalingan oila aʼzosi mavjud oila</span></p></td><td style="width: 8.34%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding: 0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height: 14.2pt" valign="top" width="8%"><p style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;margin: 0in -4.0pt .0001pt 0in"></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 14.2pt"><td colspan="2" style="width: 30.8%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding: 0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height: 14.2pt" valign="top" width="30%"><p style="text-align: justify;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;margin: 0in 2.8pt .0001pt 2.8pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt">Yongʻin, baxtsiz hodisa, tabiiy yoki texnogen favqulodda vaziyatlardan jabrlangan oila</span></p></td><td style="width: 8.34%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding: 0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height: 14.2pt" valign="top" width="8%"><p style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;margin: 0in -4.0pt .0001pt 0in"></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 14.2pt"><td rowspan="5" style="width: 3.0%;border: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height: 14.2pt" width="3%"><p align="center" style="text-align: center;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt">10.</span></p></td><td rowspan="5" style="width: 54.48%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding: 0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height: 14.2pt" valign="top" width="54%"><p style="text-align: justify;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;margin: 0in 2.8pt .0001pt 5.55pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt">Oila aʼzolarining davlat tomonidan taqdim etilgan qoʻllab-quvvatlash choralariga ehtiyojining mavjudligi</span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin: 0in 2.8pt .0001pt 5.55pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><em style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif">(xizmat va yordamlar har bir oila aʼzolari boʻyicha tanlanadi)</em></span></p></td><td colspan="2" style="width: 30.8%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding: 0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height: 14.2pt" valign="top" width="30%"><p style="text-align: justify;margin: 0in 2.8pt .0001pt 2.8pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><strong style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif">Bandlik yoʻnalishida</strong></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;margin: 0in 2.85pt .0001pt 6.2pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt">Kasb-hunarga oʻqitish;</span></p><p style="text-align: justify;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;margin: 0in 2.85pt .0001pt 6.2pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt">Tadbirkorlikka jalb etish <em>(kredit, ssuda, subsidiya va h.k);</em></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;margin: 0in 2.85pt .0001pt 6.2pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt">ishga joylashtirish;</span></p><p style="text-align: justify;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;margin: 0in 2.85pt .0001pt 6.2pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt">...</span></p></td><td style="width: 8.34%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding: 0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height: 14.2pt" valign="top" width="8%"><p style="margin-right: -4.0pt;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif"></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 14.2pt"><td colspan="2" style="width: 30.8%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding: 0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height: 14.2pt" valign="top" width="30%"><p style="text-align: justify;margin: 0in 2.8pt .0001pt 2.8pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><strong style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif">Taʼlim yoʻnalishida</strong></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;margin: 0in 2.85pt .0001pt 6.25pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt">bogʻchaga joylashtirish;</span></p><p style="text-align: justify;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;margin: 0in 2.85pt .0001pt 6.25pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt">toʻgarakka joylashtirish;</span></p><p style="text-align: justify;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;margin: 0in 2.85pt .0001pt 6.25pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt">taʼlim krediti ajratish;</span></p><p style="text-align: justify;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;margin: 0in 2.85pt .0001pt 6.25pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt">kontrakt toʻlovini toʻlashda yordam berish;</span></p><p style="text-align: justify;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;margin: 0in 2.85pt .0001pt 6.25pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt">...</span></p></td><td style="width: 8.34%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding: 0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height: 14.2pt" valign="top" width="8%"><p align="center" style="text-align: center;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;margin: 0in -4.0pt .0001pt 11.35pt"></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 14.2pt"><td colspan="2" style="width: 30.8%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding: 0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height: 14.2pt" valign="top" width="30%"><p style="text-align: justify;margin: 0in 2.8pt .0001pt 2.8pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><strong style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif">Sogʻliqni saqlash yoʻnalishida</strong></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;margin: 0in 2.85pt .0001pt 6.2pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt">Salomatligini tiklash</span></p><p style="text-align: justify;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;margin: 0in 2.85pt .0001pt 6.2pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt">Jarrohlik amaliyoti oʻtkazish</span></p><p style="text-align: justify;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;margin: 0in 2.85pt .0001pt 6.2pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt">Bepul dori-darmon</span></p><p style="text-align: justify;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;margin: 0in 2.85pt .0001pt 6.2pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt">...</span></p></td><td style="width: 8.34%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding: 0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height: 14.2pt" valign="top" width="8%"><p align="center" style="text-align: center;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;margin: 0in -4.0pt .0001pt 11.35pt"></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 14.2pt"><td colspan="2" style="width: 30.8%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding: 0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height: 14.2pt" valign="top" width="30%"><p style="text-align: justify;margin: 0in 2.8pt .0001pt 2.8pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><strong style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif">Ijtimoiy yoʻnalishda</strong></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;margin: 0in 2.85pt .0001pt 6.2pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt">Nogironlikni belgilash</span></p><p style="text-align: justify;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;margin: 0in 2.85pt .0001pt 6.2pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt">Bolalar nafaqasi, moddiy yordam</span></p><p style="text-align: justify;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;margin: 0in 2.85pt .0001pt 6.2pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt">Qarab turish va kunduzgi qatnov xizmatlari</span></p><p style="text-align: justify;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;margin: 0in 2.85pt .0001pt 6.2pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt">Nogironligi boʻlgan shaxslar uchun vositalar</span></p><p style="text-align: justify;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;margin: 0in 2.85pt .0001pt 6.2pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt">...</span></p></td><td style="width: 8.34%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding: 0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height: 14.2pt" valign="top" width="8%"><p align="center" style="text-align: center;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;margin: 0in -4.0pt .0001pt 11.35pt"></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 14.2pt"><td colspan="2" style="width: 30.8%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding: 0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height: 14.2pt" valign="top" width="30%"><p style="text-align: justify;margin: 0in 2.8pt .0001pt 2.8pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><strong style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif">Yashash sharoitini yaxshilash yoʻnalishida</strong></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;margin: 0in 2.85pt .0001pt 6.2pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt">Ipoteka krediti</span></p><p style="text-align: justify;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;margin: 0in 2.85pt .0001pt 6.2pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt">Uy joy taʼmiri</span></p><p style="text-align: justify;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;margin: 0in 2.85pt .0001pt 6.2pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt">...</span></p></td><td style="width: 8.34%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding: 0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height: 14.2pt" valign="top" width="8%"><p align="center" style="text-align: center;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;margin: 0in -4.0pt .0001pt 11.35pt"></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 14.2pt"><td colspan="5" style="width: 3.0%;border: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height: 14.2pt" width="3%"><p align="center" style="text-align: center;margin: 0in 2.8pt .0001pt 2.8pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><strong style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif">V. Ilova qilinadigan hujjatlar (mavjud boʻlsa):</strong></span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 14.2pt"><td colspan="5" style="width: 3.0%;border: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top: none;padding: 0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height: 14.2pt" width="3%"><p style="text-align: justify;text-indent: 17.35pt;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;margin: 0in 2.8pt .0001pt 2.8pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt">a) oilaning aʼzosi harbiy taʼlim muassasasida taʼlim olayotganligini, chet elda oliy taʼlim muassasasi talabasi ekanligini, chet el mamlakatida jazoni ijro etish joylarida ekanligini tasdiqlovchi hujjat;</span></p><p style="text-align: justify;text-indent: 17.35pt;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;margin: 0in 2.8pt .0001pt 2.8pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt">b) ariza toʻldirilayotgan vaqtda ariza beruvchi oʻzi va oila aʼzolari nomidagi tijorat banki hisobvaraqlaridagi mablagʻ qoldiqlari va ariza berilgan oydan oldingi uch oy mobaynida ularning nomiga oʻtkazilgan pul oʻtkazmalari yuzasidan maʼlumotlarni Markaziy bank tomonidan “YAMIH”ATga taqdim etish toʻgʻrisida oilada birga yashovchi 18 yosh va undan katta yoshdagi muomalaga layoqatli barcha oila aʼzolari imzolari bilan tasdiqlangan ariza;</span></p><p style="text-align: justify;text-indent: 17.35pt;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;margin: 0in 2.8pt .0001pt 2.8pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt">v) oilaning Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi va xorijiy davlatlar hududida tabiiy va texnogen xususiyatli favqulodda vaziyatlar, shu jumladan, maishiy tusdagi ofatlardan (turar joyning yongʻini yoki qulashi, transport vositasining yongʻini) jabrlanganligini yoki yagona boquvchisi baxtsiz hodisaga (yoʻl transport hodisasi, mehnatda mayib boʻlish kabi holatlar) uchraganligini tasdiqlovchi hujjat.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border: none" width="39"></td><td style="border: none" width="395"></td><td style="border: none" width="129"></td><td style="border: none" width="88"></td><td style="border: none" width="57"></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class="FOOTNOTE"><div name="-8030171" id="-8030171"><i>Izoh.</i></div></div><div class="FOOTNOTE"><div name="-8030172" id="-8030172"><i>1. Oila aʼzolarining maqomi idoralararo axborot almashinuvi orqali olingan hollarda, elektron maʼlumotlar inobatga olinadi.</i></div></div><div class="FOOTNOTE"><div name="-8030173" id="-8030173"><i>2. Ariza beruvchi arizada koʻrsatilgan maʼlumotlar va arizaga ilova qilingan hujjatlarning haqqoniyligi uchun javobgar hisoblanadi.</i></div></div><div class="FOOTNOTE"><div name="-8030174" id="-8030174"><i>3. Oilaning ogʻir hayotiy vaziyatga tushganligini tasdiqlovchi hujjatlar arizaga ilova qilinmagan hollarda ariza beruvchi yashaydigan mahallaga biriktirilgan ijtimoiy xodim ushbu hujjatlarni mustaqil ravishda olishi mumkin.</i></div></div><div class="FOOTNOTE"><div name="-8030175" id="-8030175"><i>4. Soʻrovnomada rozilik beriladigan ofertalar:</i></div></div><div class="FOOTNOTE"><div name="-8030176" id="-8030176"><i>Vakolatli organni oila aʼzolarimning tarkibi (bola tugʻilganligi, vafot etganligi yoki boshqa holatlar), yashash joyim oʻzgarganligi yoki boshqa oʻzgarishlar sodir boʻlganida oʻz vaqtida xabardor qilish majburiyatini olaman.</i></div></div><div class="FOOTNOTE"><div name="-8030177" id="-8030177"><i>Taqdim etilgan hujjatlarning ishonchliligini kafolatlayman va javobgarlikni oʻz zimmamga olaman.</i></div></div><div class="FOOTNOTE"><div name="-8030178" id="-8030178"><i>Mening va oila aʼzolarimning ish haqlarini va boshqa barcha daromadlarini hamda mulkiy va moddiy holatimizning tekshirilishiga rozilik beraman.</i></div></div><div class="FOOTNOTE"><div name="-8030179" id="-8030179"><i>Uy xoʻjaligimizda mavjud chorva mollari, parrandalari soni, oila aʼzolarim nomiga rasmiylashtirilmagan biroq oilamning foydalanuvida boʻlgan avtotransport vositalari, noturar binolari, qoʻshimcha turar koʻchmas mulklari hamda bogʻ va dehqon xoʻjaligi yerlari va boshqa taqdim qilgan hujjatlarim toʻgʻrisida maʼlumotlarning ishonchliligi uchun javobgarlikni tushunaman va toʻliq qabul qilaman hamda yuqorida qayd etilgan maʼlumotlarning notoʻgʻriligi aniqlangan taqdirda, qonunchilik hujjatlariga muvofiq javob berishim haqida xabardorman.</i></div></div><div class="FOOTNOTE"><div name="-8030180" id="-8030180"><i>Ushbu maʼlumotlarni haqqoniyligi yuzasidan “mahalla yettiligi” aʼzolarini xonadonimga kelib oʻrganish oʻtkazishiga rozilik bildiraman.</i></div></div><div class="FOOTNOTE"><div name="-8030181" id="-8030181"><i>* Qarindoshlik darajasi kodlanishi:</i></div></div><div class="FOOTNOTE"><div name="-8030182" id="-8030182"><i>01 — er;</i></div></div><div class="FOOTNOTE"><div name="-8030183" id="-8030183"><i>02 — xotin;</i></div></div><div class="FOOTNOTE"><div name="-8030184" id="-8030184"><i>03 — farzand;</i></div></div><div class="FOOTNOTE"><div name="-8030185" id="-8030185"><i>04 — ota/ona;</i></div></div><div class="FOOTNOTE"><div name="-8030186" id="-8030186"><i>05 — opa/singil, aka/uka;</i></div></div><div class="FOOTNOTE"><div name="-8030187" id="-8030187"><i>** maqom turlari kodlanishi:</i></div></div><div class="FOOTNOTE"><div name="-8030188" id="-8030188"><i>06 — chet eldagi oliy taʼlim muassasasi talabasi (oʻqishning faqat kunduzgi shakli boʻlganida belgilanadi);</i></div></div><div class="FOOTNOTE"><div name="-8030189" id="-8030189"><i>07 — muddatli harbiy xizmatni oʻtashi sababli oilada boʻlmagan shaxs;</i></div></div><div class="FOOTNOTE"><div name="-8030190" id="-8030190"><i>08 — harbiy taʼlim muassasasida taʼlim olishi sababli oilada boʻlmagan shaxs;</i></div></div><div class="FOOTNOTE"><div name="-8030191" id="-8030191"><i>09 — Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Mudofaa vazirligi, Ichki ishlar vazirligi, Favqulodda vaziyatlar vazirligi, Davlat xavfsizlik xizmati, Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Prezidenti Davlat xavfsizlik xizmati, Milliy gvardiya, Iqtisodiyot va moliya vazirligi huzuridagi Bojxona qoʻmitasi, Mudofaa vazirligi huzuridagi Mudofaa sanoati agentligi hamda ularning tizimidagi tashkilotlar xizmatchilari va xodimlari hamda pensionerlari;</i></div></div><div class="FOOTNOTE"><div name="-8030192" id="-8030192"><i>10 — chet elda jazoni ijro etish muassasalarida boʻlganligi munosabati bilan oilada boʻlmagan shaxs.</i></div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="-8030193" id="-8030193"></div></div><div class="APPL_BANNER_LANDSCAPE_TITLE"><div name="-8030194" id="-8030194">Ijtimoiy reyestrni yuritish tartibi toʻgʻrisidagi <a href="https://lex.uz/uz/docs/-8027513#-8029846">nizomga</a><br />2a-ILOVA</div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="-8030195" id="-8030195"></div></div><div class="TABLE_STD2"><div name="-8035588" id="-8035588"><table class="Table" style="width: 737px;border-collapse: collapse" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:25%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;height:19px"></td><td style="width: 265px;padding: 0cm 4px;height: 19px"></td><td style="width: 268px;padding: 0cm 4px;height: 19px"><p align="right" style="text-align:right"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>NAMUNA</b></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:25%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;height:19px"></td><td style="width: 265px;padding: 0cm 4px;height: 19px"></td><td style="width: 268px;padding: 0cm 4px;height: 19px"></td></tr><tr><td style="width:25%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;height:19px"></td><td style="width: 265px;padding: 0cm 4px;height: 19px"></td><td style="width: 268px;padding: 0cm 4px;height: 19px"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Markaziy banki, tijorat banklari va “Kredit-axborot tahliliy markazi” Kredit byurosi MCHJga</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:25%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;height:19px"></td><td style="width: 265px;padding: 0cm 4px;height: 19px"></td><td style="width: 268px;padding: 0cm 4px;height: 19px"><p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Quyidagi manzilda yashaydigan fuqaro</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:25%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;height:19px"></td><td style="width: 265px;padding: 0cm 4px;height: 19px"></td><td style="width: 268px;padding: 0cm 4px;height: 19px"><p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Tuman (shahar) ___________________</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:25%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;height:19px"></td><td style="width: 265px;padding: 0cm 4px;height: 19px"></td><td style="width: 268px;padding: 0cm 4px;height: 19px"><p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Mahalla ________________________</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:25%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;height:19px"></td><td style="width: 265px;padding: 0cm 4px;height: 19px"></td><td style="width: 268px;padding: 0cm 4px;height: 19px"><p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">koʻcha (kvartal) ___________________</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:25%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;height:19px"></td><td style="width: 265px;padding: 0cm 4px;height: 19px"></td><td style="width: 268px;padding: 0cm 4px;height: 19px"><p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Uy _____________________________</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:25%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;height:19px"></td><td style="width: 265px;padding: 0cm 4px;height: 19px"></td><td style="width: 268px;padding: 0cm 4px;height: 19px"><p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">xona ___________________________</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:25%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;height:19px"></td><td style="width: 265px;padding: 0cm 4px;height: 19px"></td><td style="width: 268px;padding: 0cm 4px;height: 19px"><p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">_____________________ tomonidan</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:25%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;height:19px"></td><td style="width: 265px;padding: 0cm 4px;height: 19px"></td><td style="width: 268px;padding: 0cm 4px;height: 19px" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><i><span style="font-size:10.0pt">(ariza beruvchining F.I.O)</span></i></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:25%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;height:19px"></td><td style="width: 265px;padding: 0cm 4px;height: 19px"></td><td style="width: 268px;padding: 0cm 4px;height: 19px"></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="width: 725px;padding: 0cm 4px;height: 19px"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>ARIZA</b></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:25%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;height:19px"></td><td style="width: 265px;padding: 0cm 4px;height: 19px"></td><td style="width: 268px;padding: 0cm 4px;height: 19px"></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="width: 725px;padding: 0cm 4px;height: 19px"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:14.2pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">20___ yil holatiga koʻra, mening yoki oila aʼzolarimning nomiga ochilgan depozit hisobvaraqlaridagi qoldiq mablagʻlar va ularga hisoblangan foiz daromadlari hamda ariza berilgan sanadan oldingi uch oy mobaynida mening yoki oila aʼzolarimning nomiga olingan pul oʻtkazmalari toʻgʻrisidagi hamda men va oila aʼzolarimning kredit tarixiga oid maʼlumotlarni “Yagona milliy ijtimoiy himoya” axborot tizimiga taqdim etishingizni soʻraymiz.</span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:14.2pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ushbu ariza bilan men va oila aʼzolarim tanishib, yuqorida koʻrsatilgan maʼlumotlarning taqdim etilishiga rozilik berganimizni tasdiqlab imzo chekmoqdamiz.</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:25%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;height:19px"></td><td style="width: 265px;padding: 0cm 4px;height: 19px"></td><td style="width: 268px;padding: 0cm 4px;height: 19px"></td></tr><tr><td style="width:25%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;height:19px"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:14.2pt"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ariza beruvchi</span></span></p></td><td style="