0197" id="-8030197"><i>Izoh. Oila aʼzosiga — ota-ona, turmush oʻrtogʻi va ariza beruvchi bilan birga yashovchi oʻz oilasiga ega boʻlmagan 18 yosh va undan katta yoshli farzandlari koʻrsatiladi.</i></div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="-8030198" id="-8030198"></div></div><div class="APPL_BANNER_LANDSCAPE_TITLE"><div name="-8030199" id="-8030199">Ijtimoiy reyestrni yuritish tartibi toʻgʻrisidagi <a href="https://lex.uz/uz/docs/-8027513#-8029846">nizomga</a><br />3-ILOVA</div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="-8030200" id="-8030200"></div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="-8255672" id="-8255672"></div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="-8255679" id="-8255679"><table class="Table" style="width: 815px;border-collapse: collapse;border: none" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;height:19px;border-top:none;border-right:none;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="border:none;text-align:center"></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:43%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;height:19px;border-top:none;border-right:none;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="border:none;text-align:center"></p></td><td colspan="6" style="border-width: initial;border-style: none;border-color: initial;width: 420px;padding: 0cm 4px;height: 19px"><p align="right" style="border:none;text-align:right"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="layout-grid-mode:char"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">NAMUNA</span></span></span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:none;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;height:19px;border-top:none;border-right:none;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="border:none;text-align:center"></p></td><td style="border-bottom:none;width:43%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;height:19px;border-top:none;border-right:none;border-left:none"><p align="