olid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt;height:14.2pt" width="17%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;line-height:normal;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ijtimoiy himoya milliy agentligi, Iqtisodiyot va moliya vazirligi</p></td><td style="width:1.0%;border-top:none;border-left:none;border-bottom:  solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt;height:14.2pt" width="1%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;line-height:normal;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="width:47.0%;border-top:none;border-left:  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt;height:14.2pt" width="47%"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:8.5pt;line-height:  normal;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Oilalarga bolalar nafaqasi yoki moddiy yordam toʻlash uchun mablagʻlarni moliyaviy agentning maxsus hisob varagʻiga moliyalashtiradi.</p></td><td style="width:1.0%;border-top:none;border-left:none;border-bottom:  solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt;height:14.2pt" width="1%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;line-height:normal;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="width:18.0%;border-top:none;border-left:  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt;height:14.2pt" width="18%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;line-height:normal;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Toʻlov amalga oshiriladigan oyning 4 — 25-sanasi davomida</p></td></tr><tr style="height:14.2pt"><td style="width:1.0%;border:none;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt;height:14.2pt" width="1%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;line-height:normal;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"></