r-left:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height:14.2pt" valign="top" width="1%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;line-height:normal"><b style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> </b></p></td><td style="width:18.0%;border:none;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height:14.2pt" valign="top" width="18%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;line-height:normal;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1. 3 ish kuni ichida</p></td></tr><tr style="height:14.2pt"><td style="width:1.0%;border:none;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height:14.2pt" width="1%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;line-height:normal"><b style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> </b></p></td><td style="width:1.0%;border:none;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height:14.2pt" width="1%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;line-height:normal"><b style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> </b></p></td><td style="width:47.0%;border-top:none;border-left:  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height:14.2pt" valign="top" width="47%"><p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:10.55pt;line-height:  normal;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2. Maʼmuriy hujjat qayta rasmiylashtirilgandan soʻng apellyatsiya kengash ini xabardor qiladi.</p></td><td style="width:1.0%;border:none;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt;height:14.2pt" valign="top" width="1%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;line-height:normal"><b style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"> </b></p></td><td style="width:18.0%;border-top:none;border-left:  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.8