gan guruhlarda bolalar soni quyidagicha belgilanadi:</div></div><div class="TABLE_STD2"><div name="-8035911" id="-8035911"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:100.0%;border-collapse:collapse" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td rowspan="2" style="width:35.7%;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt 1.5pt" width="35%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;line-height:normal;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><strong>Taʼlim yoʻnalishlari turlari va bolalar toifalari</strong></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="width:15.52%;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left:none;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt" width="15%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;line-height:normal;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><strong>Tayyorlov sinfdagi bolalar soni</strong></p></td><td colspan="2" style="width:48.78%;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left:none;padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt 1.5pt" width="48%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;line-height:normal;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><strong>Tarbiya guruhlari va kuni uzaytirilgan guruhlarning minimal toʻldirilishi</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:23.6%;border-top:none;border-left:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt 1.5pt" width="23%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;line-height:normal;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><strong>Boshlangʻich sinflardagi bolalar soni</strong></p></td><td style="width:25.18%;border-top:none;border-left:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt 1.5pt" width="25%"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;line-height:normal;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><strong>Yuqori sinflardagi bolalar soni</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:35.7%;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top:  none;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2